  "description": {
    "text": "The first XY Trainer Kit, released in Italian on 9 April 2014, held two half decks, Sylveon and Noivern, with a rule book, a two-player playmat, damage counters, a coin showing the Kalos first partner Pokémon, a deck box and a code for the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. For the first time most of a kit's cards were its own rather than reprints from the main expansions. They carry the kit's own set symbol and no rarity mark, and each half deck is numbered separately so the two can be sorted apart again.\n\nThis set holds the Sylveon half deck."
  },
